@CodolioApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5004

### Get Codolio Profile by Username
GET {{CodolioApi_HostAddress}}/api/CodolioProfile/profile/H
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Codolio Profile with Cache Bypass
GET {{CodolioApi_HostAddress}}/api/CodolioProfile/profile/harsh?bypassCache=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Profile by Full Codolio URL
GET {{CodolioApi_HostAddress}}/api/CodolioProfile/profile-by-url?url=https://codolio.com/profile/H
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Raw Profile HTML for Debugging
GET {{CodolioApi_HostAddress}}/api/CodolioProfile/raw-html/harsh
Accept: text/html